PASS selected: exact selected camera, independent native timing, cursor and requested audio routing
PASS both-audio: exact selected camera, independent native timing, cursor and requested audio routing
PASS camera acquisition omitted: exact refusal/no fallback and no unauthorized or unselected IO
PASS camera acquisition denied: exact refusal/no fallback and no unauthorized or unselected IO
PASS camera acquisition screen-denied: exact refusal/no fallback and no unauthorized or unselected IO
PASS camera acquisition absent: exact refusal/no fallback and no unauthorized or unselected IO
PASS camera acquisition disappeared: exact refusal/no fallback and no unauthorized or unselected IO
PASS camera acquisition empty-selection: exact refusal/no fallback and no unauthorized or unselected IO
PASS discarded startup is fenced across await/rollback; stale callback cannot clear or cancel a newer take; physical drain once
PASS screen-start-failure: startup rollback drains once and publishes no completed camera
PASS camera-start-failure: startup rollback drains once and publishes no completed camera
PASS interrupted: shared NativeCapture lifecycle, truthful camera source and single physical drain
PASS pause-resume: shared NativeCapture lifecycle, truthful camera source and single physical drain
PASS cancel-retry: shared NativeCapture lifecycle, truthful camera source and single physical drain
PASS discard: both physical inputs drain once; no camera publication
PASS concurrent: shared NativeCapture lifecycle, truthful camera source and single physical drain
PASS no-camera: shared NativeCapture lifecycle, truthful camera source and single physical drain
PASS probe-stopped-start: shared NativeCapture lifecycle, truthful camera source and single physical drain
PASS discarded-preparation: generation ends before writer; obsolete lookup cannot open selected IO or overwrite newer take
PASS canceled-preparation: generation ends before writer; obsolete lookup cannot open selected IO or overwrite newer take
PASS returned-preparation: generation ends before writer; obsolete lookup cannot open selected IO or overwrite newer take
